{"step_index":212,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T00:38:28Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-15T09:38:28+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-15T09:38:31+09:00\nThe search for \"\"bluerecorders.com\" OR \"oceanbluerecording.com\"\" returned the following summary:\nThese are two separate recording studio businesses, both located in the Atlanta, Georgia area:\n\n*   **Blue Recorders (bluerecorders.com):** This is a prominent recording studio facility with locations in Atlanta (Blue South) and Los Angeles (Blue West)[1][2]. They are known for hosting high-profile clients, including artists such as Andre 3000, Donald Glover, Travis Scott, Playboi Carti, and Summer Walker[3][2]. Their Atlanta studio is located at 500 Bishop Street[3].\n\n*   **Ocean Blue Recording (oceanbluerecording.com):** This is a recording studio located in Decatur, Georgia (minutes from Atlanta)[4][5]. They offer a variety of services, including vocal recording, mixing, podcast recording, and beat production, and cater to both independent artists and local organizations[6][7][8]. Their facility is located at 2223 Candler Rd, Decatur, GA[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [ams-neve.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFQCH09fcyDFvdFH70u7TpKswrJYDmI7rUzfC1SPay0-3_ZL8JARuKtBdlG_ddOgYgBDKQQbX5wjRnyjToqcMBSvTTTAq3CjrsVYIyfCpq2bVzyzN-XZejlXCjAXZDC7TRYpuw_czkad-q99bc5RVyc90Vf5oIo50-BlBMwA6CfQ3Wj_9qQHTdDaDc5Vjpx17jl-Kg=)\n[2] [digitalmarketingdeal.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH5et3GZQ8VPdR2cbMBcqi3eS2DU_37y9cSmTsqH6DRN30BjdMRwAMH8Tl4_WQ9ZFoaAC8vnmEU04ryV5IgcofVzkKLvVuchO89jMl8cGrUeAwdd0Aeen86FMNhI9GbBUZN3AXedf1pcSWVraoE9X9GgVIv8kRG8aal)\n[3] [bluerecorders.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFLsqMyBwGCCGymqv-u9KPmXCbc2R_XsqyZwzarkGEl4iHAEoYEUCQC8ug6m_Wna2wEiDcAidejiCH62cANArfB8sTVeglDYpQ-fH5chx_E5nbCaN0=)\n[4] [oceanbluerecording.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.googl