{"step_index":225,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T00:39:02Z","thinking":"Initial search yielded no public information; however, a potential Korean connection for the provided number arose. Korean personal cell phone numbers, specifically those starting with \"010\", are typically unlisted in public directories, suggesting privacy restrictions are likely the cause of the initial lack of data.\n\n\nThe provided data points for `센텀아트` show a confirmed match with existing business registration information, including the business registration number.  However, for `블루레코딩`, the absence of a business registration number and the presence of a mobile number suggest a potential unregistered business, a sole proprietorship, or a freelancer operating under the trade name. The \"010\" prefix further supports the high likelihood of a Korean personal mobile number being the primary contact.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"\\\"부산\\\" \\\"녹음실\\\" \\\"블루\\\" OR \\\"BLUE\\\"\"","toolAction":"\"부산 녹음실 블루 검색 중\"","toolSummary":"\"부산 녹음실 블루 검색\""}}]}
{"step_index":226,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T00:39:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-15T09:39:09+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-15T09:39:12+09:00\nThe search for \"\"부산\" \"녹음실\" \"블루\" OR \"BLUE\"\" returned the following summary:\n부산에서 '블루(BLUE)'와 관련된 녹음실 및 스튜디오 정보는 다음과 같습니다.\n\n*   **블루엘 녹음실 (Blue L Recording Studio):** 콘텐츠 제작 및 포트폴리오 작업을 수행하는 녹음실입니다[1][2].\n*   **스튜디오 블루 (Studio Blue):** 부산 남구 유엔로215번길 35에 위치한 스튜디오로, 주로 사진 촬영 관련 서비스로 안내되고 있습니다[3].\n*   **블루바이브 (Blue Vibe):** 부산 서면에 위치한 댄스 및 보컬 연습실입니다[4].\n\n검색 결과 중 **'레블 스튜디오(Reble Studio)'**라는 곳이 부산 녹음실(부산광역시 소재)로 등록되어 있으나, '블루'와의 직접적인 연관성은 확인되지 않았습니다[5][6]. 또한, 서울 서초구에는 '블루소노(BlueSono) 레코딩 스튜디오'라는 전문 녹음실이 있으니 혼동하지 않도록 주의하시기 바랍니다[7].\n\n찾으시는 특정 업체가 위 목록에 없다면, 정확한 상호명이나 위치 정보를 추가로 확인해 보시는 것을 추천드립니다.\n\nSources:\n[1] [blue-l.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJXsqSrqf-o4yV0HgYa3XFVHoDljy4opi1Ur7WfHTeqvG6Lmie6nGQrOXE6mXI8sxYabIfHIVZhy3LrDuxL086FOc8y7a825zXnSjFBeSmx1bFIeY=)\n[2] [blue-l.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJXsqSrqf-o4yV0HgYa3XFVHoDljy4opi1Ur7WfHTeqvG6Lmie6nGQrOXE6mXI8sxYabIfHIVZhy3LrDuxL086FOc8y7a825zXnSjFBeSmx1bFIeY=)\n[3] [dir.today](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGW3sJPuq2GQSEMV8cQp4VsneW5ckUT3ofTn7Wx5yPfi4nawSYbOrNyShOF6TI-QQVUZri9KN3VZatLjpKs9jNhNLvAYkZxWcuSM1twT91N1IXH7zVy2Gijam__BiyuhX1gV6fAPe2twv9IeYu-GlVLgIduvzbTuLX-9NZCPBM2)\n[4] [spacecloud.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGoD2LAEv5HuleXmSIFwOromc6ykSM4b0O8wlBWSbc1z4WAmOZs4_JHmqkIiXgNQUYAyOEQVUFMInfkINZHKYkH-M8eXtdgNYHrSm2tmS2Xucd_-Yt6-q_LRPA=)\n[5] [maptons.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEj2LG5IUMGycj4ZwIzxDSfaMXjGQIQDZ-O_weHCVkUkRq90-K3h7fwot0wCOYj8Orw_VOW6H7K7VGnqIdikdjTqDiBOkDXjRimqH6sI-O0KdN06vhGQQGS)\n[6] [maptons.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZI